WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.154
Fourier series, almost everywhere.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.649
Square-integrable signals converge; merely integrable ones can fail. Where is the line?

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.779
Reduce to a dyadic tree, then cap

4
00:00:10.779 --> 00:00:12.757
the total cost with an entropy budget.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.491
Claimed: L log L signals converge almost everywhere.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.050
No Lean proof.
